    <string name="gms_hint_body">This phone is in High accuracy mode, so Google scans nearby Wi-Fi and Bluetooth to work out where you really are — and that can override the mock in Google Maps and other Google-based apps.\n\nSet Location to GPS only (turn off Wi-Fi and Bluetooth scanning) and Google Maps will follow Waypoint.</string>
